(This test creates a REAL character device node, matching /dev/null's major/minor.)
(mknod for character/block devices requires root or CAP_MKNOD, so this is)
(NOT auto-run in CI - there's deliberately no .expected file, so test.sh skips it.)
(Run manually with: sudo ./target/release/vox tests/manual_mknod_device.vox --run)

Delete the file "/tmp/vox_test_mknod_device".

Create a device node called "/tmp/vox_test_mknod_device" with type "c" major 1 minor 3.
On error print "mknod failed - are you root?", exit 1.
Print "mknod succeeded".

Delete the file "/tmp/vox_test_mknod_device".
